# LifeMax core rule

Read @AGENTS.md and @docs/PRODUCT.md before significant work.

- Build a character OS, not a generic habit tracker.
- Do not introduce a universal life score.
- Favor minimal, high-coherence product loops over feature sprawl.
- TypeScript strict mode; keep domain logic out of presentation components.
- For integrations, create provider adapters and minimize sensitive data retention.
- Update @docs/ROADMAP.md when meaningful milestones are completed.
